When you create an account or purchase a product, we may collect information such as:

• Name
• Email address
• Phone number
• Username
• Account identifiers
• Billing address
• Subscription status
• Purchase history
• Account preferences

Career and Professional Information

Certain Victory services may allow you to provide information related to your professional background, including:

• Employment history
• Job titles
• Work experience
• Skills
• Professional accomplishments
• Education
• Certifications
• Claims licenses
• Professional licenses
• Resume information
• Salary goals
• Career goals
• Preferred job types
• Industry background
• Target career paths
• Geographic preferences
• Work-environment preferences

This information may be used to personalize educational content, career analysis, recommendations, and AI-generated responses.

2. AI CONVERSATIONS AND USER SUBMISSIONS

When you interact with Victory AI or other artificial intelligence features, we may process:

• Questions you submit
• AI conversation history
• Career information included in your messages
• Uploaded documents
• Resume information
• Job descriptions
• User feedback
• Saved career-profile information
• AI-generated recommendations and analyses

This information may be processed to provide the service, maintain conversation context, improve platform functionality, personalize responses, detect misuse, and support users.

You should not submit highly sensitive or confidential information through Victory AI unless a specific feature expressly requests it.

Do not submit information such as:

• Social Security numbers
• Full financial account numbers
• Passwords
• Medical records
• Protected health information
• Claimant personal information
• Confidential insurance claim files
• Policy numbers
• Confidential employer information
• Trade secrets belonging to another organization
• Information you are legally or contractually prohibited from sharing

3. PAYMENT INFORMATION

